# 霸王茶姬 @ArthasYZ

# EMS @ArthasYZ //ec.ems.com.cn, ump.ems.com.cn
request if ${url} ~= /^https?:\/\/ec\.ems\.com\.cn\/mailAd$/i then reject(404)
